<title>USA: Catherines sees Q4 loss over $0.09/shr.</title>
<headline>Catherines sees Q4 loss over $0.09/shr.</headline>
<dateline>MEMPHIS, Tenn. 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Catherines Stores Corp said Thursday that it expects its fourth quarter loss to exceed last year's adjusted fourth quarter loss of $0.09 per share.</p>
<p>The company attributed the loss to its December sales performance. Earlier Thursday it reported that December same-store fell 10.1 percent.</p>
<p>The company said its reported 1995 fourth quarter loss is $0.32 including a $0.23 charge to write-off impaired assets and closed stores.</p>
</text>
